                                              <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/Dcm/DcmConfigSet/DcmDsp/DcmDspRoutine/DcmDspRequestRoutineResults/DcmDspRequestRoutineResultsIn/DcmDspRequestRoutineResultsInSignalCompositePool</DESTINATION-REF>
                                            </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
